  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "Coordgen 是 Schrödinger 开源的 C++ 库，用于为分子结构生成高质量的 2D 坐标。它以力场最小化和片段装配为核心，特别擅长处理大环、金属配合物及典型类药小分子，目标用户为化学信息学工具、分子可视化软件和 RDKit 等下游库的开发者。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "2D 分子坐标生成",
        "description": "为分子图生成美观的 2D 平面坐标，主入口为 sketcherMinimizer::runGenerateCoordinates。",
        "evidence": ["sketcherMinimizer.h:81-94", "example_dir/example.cpp:4-23"]
      },
      {
        "name": "分子图模型",
        "description": "提供原子、键、分子、片段等对象模型，用于构建和操作待布局的化学结构。",
        "evidence": ["sketcherMinimizerMolecule.h", "sketcherMinimizerAtom.h", "sketcherMinimizerBond.h"]
      },
      {
        "name": "力场最小化与冲突消除",
        "description": "通过拉伸、弯曲、冲突等约束进行力场最小化，消除原子与键的交叉。",
        "evidence": ["CoordgenMinimizer.h:86-189", "sketcherMinimizer.h:100-106"]
      },
      {
        "name": "片段构建与装配",
        "description": "将分子拆分为刚性片段并基于模板或几何规则装配。",
        "evidence": ["CoordgenFragmentBuilder.h", "CoordgenFragmenter.h", "sketcherMinimizerFragment.h"]
      },
      {
        "name": "大环构建",
        "description": "针对难以用常规多边形绘制的大环系统生成合理的 2D 形状。",
        "evidence": ["CoordgenMacrocycleBuilder.h", "CoordgenMacrocycleBuilder.cpp"]
      },
      {
        "name": "模板化环系定位",
        "description": "使用内置模板（templates.mae 编译进 CoordgenTemplates.cpp）辅助常见复杂环系的绘制。",
        "evidence": ["CoordgenTemplates.h", "CoordgenTemplates.cpp", "sketcherMinimizer.cpp:3590-3607"]
      },
      {
        "name": "蛋白残基相互作用布局",
        "description": "在蛋白-蛋白相互作用图中为残基链（SSE）安排空间位置。",
        "evidence": ["sketcherMinimizer.h:447-457", "CoordgenMinimizer.h:110-124"]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "chemistry / cheminformatics",
